From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:49:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: accept the schema and IBus releases of Fedora 41

Fedora 41 and Alpine 3.21 ship gsettings-desktop-schemas 47.1 and IBus
1.5.31.

The 47.1 headers have every enum value that the code uses. The only
keys that 48.0 adds are the screen-time-limits keys, which the code
does not read. The input settings of later schemas stay available only
in the Gnoblin Lua configuration, as with 48.0.

The Gnoblin IBus input method uses no IBus 1.5.32 API, so with IBus
1.5.31 it works as with 1.5.32. Without this change the build silently
left the IBus input method out.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index a900eae0e..af18c701d 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@ pango_req = '>= 1.46.0'
 cairo_req = '>= 1.10.0'
 pangocairo_req = '>= 1.20'
 pixman_req = '>= 0.42'
-gsettings_desktop_schemas_req = '>= 48.0'
+gsettings_desktop_schemas_req = '>= 47.1'
 x11_req = '>= 1.7.0'
 xcomposite_req = '>= 0.4'
 xkbcommon_req = '>= 0.4.3'
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@ hyprcursor_dep = dependency('hyprcursor', version: '>= 0.1.11', required: get_op
 have_hyprcursor = hyprcursor_dep.found()
 if have_hyprcursor
 endif
-ibus_dep = dependency('ibus-1.0', version: '>= 1.5.32', required: get_option('ibus'))
+ibus_dep = dependency('ibus-1.0', version: '>= 1.5.31', required: get_option('ibus'))
 have_ibus = ibus_dep.found()
 pixman_dep = dependency('pixman-1', version: pixman_req)
 gsettings_desktop_schemas_dep = dependency('gsettings-desktop-schemas',
